From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:56:08 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: a sleeping tab looks asleep in the sidebar

A tab put to sleep (discarded) shows a dimmed favicon with a small moon in
its corner, in Today and as a pinned tab, until it loads again. The state
comes with the sidebar's tab info (TabInfo.asleep, appended), sent again
when a tab is put to sleep or starts loading.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
---
